From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: redox-rpi
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:50:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] orblogin: keep the login picture only at window size

orblogin kept the decoded login picture at full size for its whole
life, a clone of it, and the picture scaled to cover the window
(larger than the window in zoom mode). Decode it only when the window
size changes and scale only the visible part straight into a picture
of the window's size (bilinear), then drop the original. The whole
scaled copy is never made: freed memory is not given back, so the
peak is what stays. At 1824x984 the picture costs 7 MB, against
3 + 10 MB before.
---
 orbutils/src/orblogin/main.rs | 157 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 127 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/orbutils/src/orblogin/main.rs b/orbutils/src/orblogin/main.rs
